# Track Rust sources, TOML, the root README, the Mio SVG and git's own files.
*
!*/
!*.rs
!*.toml
!/README.md
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!/assets/mio-mark.svg

# Never tracked, even where they contain such files: build output, local
# investigation backups, the analyzed game and a third-party reference.
/target/
# Analysis notes, reports and tools stay local.
/analysis/
/.analysis-cache/
/Microsoft.MinecraftUWP_*/
/dll-oss-main/